/-!
# MassGap.SUNFromScale — the `SU(N)` capstone at the block-step observer, from the flow-side inputs

The flow-side inputs are the substrate core `SubstrateCoreAt`, `GradientFlowPropsN`, `ProxyGenLim` and a
three-point clause. This module states the capstone from them at every `N ≥ 2`, at the observer `ObserverFlowSUN.sunFam hN2 c hc0 hc s₀` (the
`SU(N)` block-step flow at scale `s₀`), with the gap `WDeltaRun.RunSeed N` as an explicit input in place
of the `SU(2)` endpoint `MultiScale.Endpoint` (refuted by `InputAudit.not_multiScaleEndpoint` under the argued
growth of the zero-flux level count). It assembles `SUNBest.InputsAt` and feeds `SUNBest.clayStatement_of_inputs`.
It proves no new mathematics. Declarations are in the namespace `MassGap.SUNFromScale`.

## 1. The inputs

At `SU(N)`, `N ≥ 2`, observer `W = sunFam hN2 c hc0 hc s₀` with `0 ≤ s₀ < r`, `z = zFix N zri zwe`:

* `hri`, `hwe`: `zri`, `zwe` nowhere zero;
* `S : SU2Best.SubstrateCoreAt W z b Wf`: `b > 0`, `Wf b = W`, `ScaleControlAll b Wf`, and a two-point
  kernel of the trace at `z` with the asymptotic-freedom coefficient;
* `F : NondegFromProxy.GradientFlowPropsN Wf cf z μ`: `ExpandStrong`, `CoefBound`, `FlowCov`, `FlowWard`
  and `ProxyNondeg` of the flowed proxies;
* `hL : ProxyGenObserver.ProxyGenLim W b Wf cf r`: the proxies are generated by the observer's margin
  monomials in the limit form;
* `h3 : ∃ ℓ > 0, NonGaussFromScale.ThreePointAtScale hN ℓ`: the three-point clause on the bare measures;
* `hfar : WDeltaRun.RunSeed N`: the gap.

## 2. What is proved

* `inputsAt_of_flow`: the inputs of §1 give `SUNBest.InputsAt hN2 W r t |C| zri zwe μ G` for some `t`,
  `C`, `G`. Derived:
  - `moments` from `scale` (`CompositesRenAll.uv_of_scale`, `ClaySUFinal.classMoments_of_siteExp`);
  - `phys` from `ObserverFlowSUN.sunFam_physRange`;
  - `low` from `NonGaussFromScale.obsLower_of_scale`;
  - `ward` from `SU2Best.wardT_of_core`;
  - `comp`: `ConvC` (`NondegFromProxy.convC_of_core`), `OS0C` (`MultiScaleOS.os0C_of_scale_expand_coef`),
    `OS1C` (`MultiScaleOS.os1C_of_scale_expand`), `CovC` (`CovFromFlow.covC_of_scale_strong`),
    `CompNondeg` (`NondegFromProxy.compNondeg_of_core`);
  - `approx` from `ApproxFromExpand.approxK_of_expandRP_SU` with `ExpandRP` from `expandRP_of_strong` and
    `ProxyGen` from `ProxyGenObserver.proxyGen_of_lim` (`ProxyBound` from
    `ProxyBoundFromScale.proxyBound_of_core`, the uniform bound from `ProxyGenObserver.uB_of_core`);
  - `kernel`, `af` from `S.af`; `far`, `hri`, `hwe` passed through.
* **`clayStatementAt_sun_flow`**: the same inputs give
  `ClayStatementAt hN2 (sunFam hN2 c hc0 hc s₀) (SymPlaqClass N) (symPlaq_refl N)`.
* `FlowInputsN N hN2`: some `c`, `s₀`, `r`, `zri`, `zwe`, `μ`, `b`, `Wf`, `cf` with the inputs of §1.
  `clayInputsN_of_flow`: it gives `SUNBest.ClayInputsN N hN2`.
* **`clayStatement_of_flow`**: `FlowInputsN N hN2` at every `N ≥ 2` gives `ClayStatementDy`.

Foundational footprint only (`#print axioms` at the end).

DERIVED (module-wide): `2` the least colour count; `0` the lower end of the observer's scale.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

namespace MassGap.SUNFromScale

open Filter
open scoped Topology
open MassGap MassGap.InfiniteLattice MassGap.ContinuumField MassGap.ContinuumSchwinger
